# Source and docs: normalise to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Sample invoices must survive a clone byte-for-byte. Git sniffed the text-layer PDFs
# (01, 02, 03) as text and offered to rewrite their line endings — which would corrupt
# them for whoever clones this. They are documents, not source. Mark them binary.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
